{
  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 404,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.261,
            0.13,
            0.713,
            0.161
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "参读材料二 蒙特卡罗方法"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.209,
            0.864,
            0.272
          ],
          "content": "我们聚焦于由给定的模型直接产生大量的样本. 这些样本反映了模型的统计性能, 有关模型的问题能由研究样本的统计性能得到回答. 我们研究样本的统计性能得到关于模型的问题的回答, 这样的方法称为蒙特卡罗方法, 又称为蒙特卡罗模拟."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.277,
            0.864,
            0.317
          ],
          "content": "如果我们能在计算机上模拟一统计模型,那么就能自模型产生一大批数据样本,也就能用研究这些样本的性质代替对模型本身的研究,从而得到所需的结果."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.322,
            0.864,
            0.362
          ],
          "content": "例 1 长方形金属板的长度 X 和宽度 Y 分别服从分布  $X \\sim U(2.9, 3.1)$  和  $Y \\sim U(1.9, 2.1)$ ，X、Y 均以 m 计，且两者相互独立。试估计金属板面积 XY 的数学期望。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.369,
            0.386,
            0.385
          ],
          "content": "解 $X, Y$ 的分布函数分别为"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.39,
            0.775,
            0.467
          ],
          "content": "F _ {X} (x) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} 0, & x <   2. 9, \\\\ \\frac {x - 2 . 9}{0 . 2}, & 2. 9 \\leqslant x <   3. 1, \\\\ 1, & x \\geqslant 3. 1. \\end{array} \\quad F _ {Y} (y) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} 0, & y <   1. 9, \\\\ \\frac {y - 1 . 9}{0 . 2}, & 1. 9 \\leqslant y <   2. 1, \\\\ 1, & y \\geqslant 2. 1. \\end{array} \\right. \\right.",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_404_equation_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.473,
            0.674,
            0.502
          ],
          "content": "现在分别产生 $X, Y$ 的随机数. 设 $U = U(0,1)$, 令 $U = \\frac{X - 2.9}{0.2}$, 得"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.421,
            0.51,
            0.864,
            0.526
          ],
          "content": "X = 2. 9 + 0. 2 U. \\tag {*1}",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_404_equation_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.534,
            0.389,
            0.564
          ],
          "content": "设 $U\\sim U(0,1)$ ，令 $V = \\frac{Y - 1.9}{0.2}$ 得"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.421,
            0.571,
            0.864,
            0.587
          ],
          "content": "Y = 1. 9 + 0. 2 V. \\tag {*_{2}}",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_404_equation_9.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.594,
            0.864,
            0.634
          ],
          "content": "按 $(\\ast_{1})$ 式产生随机变量X的10 000个随机数，按 $(\\ast_{2})$ 式产生Y的10 000个随机数，这样就得到A=XY的样本容量为10 000的样本值，列表如下:"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.645,
            0.865,
            0.789
          ],
          "content": "| 长度x | 宽度y | 面积xy |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3.055 969 | 2.091 012 | 6.390 068 |\n| 2.976 204 | 2.037 167 | 6.063 026 |\n| ⋮ | ⋮ | ⋮ |\n| 3.003 077 | 1.929 107 | 5.793 258 |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_404_table_11.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.808,
            0.864,
            0.866
          ],
          "content": "以 A 的样本均值  $\\frac{1}{10\\ 000}\\sum_{i=1}^{10\\ 000}x_{i}y_{i}$  作为金属板面积 A 的数学期望的估计, 得到面积 A 的数学期望的近似值为 6.000762 m²."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.872,
            0.864,
            0.911
          ],
          "content": "此例说明,用蒙特卡罗方法得到的 A 的数学期望,与 A 的数学期望的真值  $E(A)=E(XY)=E(X)E(Y)=6\\ m^{2}$  非常接近. □"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 405,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.395,
            0.049,
            0.624,
            0.065
          ],
          "content": "参读材料二 蒙特卡罗方法"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.801,
            0.052,
            0.866,
            0.065
          ],
          "content": "· 391 ·"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.088,
            0.884,
            0.149
          ],
          "content": "例2 设一设备需经两个独立的组装阶段. 第一阶段的组装时间 $X$ (以 $\\mathrm{h}$ 计) 是一个随机变量, 服从均值为 1 的指数分布, 第二阶段的组装时间 $Y$ 也是一个随机变量且 $Y \\sim N(3,1)$, 试估计整个组装时间 $X + Y$."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.155,
            0.559,
            0.172
          ],
          "content": "解 下面用蒙特卡罗方法给出  $X + Y$  的直方图."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.177,
            0.56,
            0.195
          ],
          "content": "设 $U\\sim U(0,1)$ ，在参读材料一例4中令 $\\theta = 1$ ，则"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.467,
            0.202,
            0.879,
            0.216
          ],
          "content": "X = - \\ln U \\quad (* _ {3})",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_405_equation_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.221,
            0.882,
            0.281
          ],
          "content": "就是均值为1的指数分布随机变量. 又按参读材料一例6, 设 $U_{i} \\sim U(0,1), i = 1,2,\\dots,12$, 且它们相互独立, 则 $X = \\sum_{i=1}^{12} U_{i} - 6 \\stackrel{\\text{近似}}{\\sim} N(0,1)$, 于是"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.471,
            0.286,
            0.879,
            0.3
          ],
          "content": "Y = X + 3 \\quad \\left(* _ {4}\\right)",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_405_equation_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.306,
            0.882,
            0.39
          ],
          "content": "近似服从正态分布 $N(3,1)$. 在计算机上分别按 $(\\ast_{3})$ 式和 $(\\ast_{4})$ 式产生 $X$ 和 $Y$ 的独立的样本值（样本容量为 10000），利用这 10000 个数据作出 $X + Y$ 的频率直方图，如图 1 所示，我们就可以用直方图顶部的台阶形曲线作为 $X + Y$ 的概率密度曲线的近似. 从而可以对随机变量 $X + Y$ 的性质作出统计推断. 例如，$X + Y$ 落在区间 (3.4, 4.2) 的概率可估计为"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.386,
            0.395,
            0.623,
            0.412
          ],
          "content": "P \\{3. 4 <   X + Y <   4. 2 \\} \\approx 0. 6 2.",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_405_equation_9.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.416,
            0.466,
            0.433
          ],
          "content": "R 语言的程序和作出的直方图如下:"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.438,
            0.424,
            0.587
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```diff\n> N = 10000; z<-numeric(N)\n> for(i in 1:N){\n+    x<-(-log(runif(1,0,1)))\n+    y<-rnorm(1,3,1)\n+    z[i]<-x+y\n+ }\n> hist(z)\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        },
        {
          "type": "chart",
          "bbox": [
            0.329,
            0.604,
            0.681,
            0.833
          ],
          "sub_type": "histogram",
          "content": "| Bin (z) | Frequency |\n| --- | --- |\n| 0~1 | ~50 |\n| 1~2 | ~500 |\n| 2~3 | ~1800 |\n| 3~4 | ~3000 |\n| 4~5 | ~2550 |\n| 5~6 | ~1250 |\n| 6~7 | ~550 |\n| 7~8 | ~200 |\n| 8~9 | ~50 |\n| 9~10 | ~25 |\n| 10~11 | ~10 |",
          "captions": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.487,
                0.841,
                0.524,
                0.857
              ],
              "content": "图1"
            }
          ],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_405_chart_12.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.876,
            0.88,
            0.915
          ],
          "content": "在统计数据分析中,许多人们感兴趣的问题能够归结为求某个随机变量 X 的函数  $h(X)$  的数学期望  $E[h(X)]$ . 令  $\\varphi(x)$  表示 X 的概率密度, 由强大数定律, 若  $X_{1}, X_{2}, \\cdots, X_{n}$  是相互独"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 406,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.051,
            0.196,
            0.065
          ],
          "content": "· 392 ·"
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.375,
            0.048,
            0.604,
            0.065
          ],
          "content": "参读材料二 蒙特卡罗方法"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.089,
            0.672,
            0.106
          ],
          "continues_prev": true,
          "content": "立的同分布的随机变量序列,它们与随机变量 X 有相同的分布,则有"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.329,
            0.112,
            0.857,
            0.144
          ],
          "content": "P \\left\\{\\lim _ {n \\to \\infty} \\frac {1}{n} \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {n} h (X _ {i}) = E [ h (X) ] \\right\\} = 1. \\tag {*5}",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_406_equation_3.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.149,
            0.731,
            0.167
          ],
          "content": "在上式中，将 $n$ 取定为充分大的数，就能得到下述求数学期望近似值的方法."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.171,
            0.842,
            0.189
          ],
          "content": "定义 用于估计数学期望 $E[h(X)]$ 的蒙特卡罗方法是一种数值方法，它基于近似式:"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.385,
            0.194,
            0.862,
            0.228
          ],
          "content": "E [ h (X) ] \\approx \\frac {1}{n} \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {n} h (X _ {i}), \\tag {*6}",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_406_equation_6.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.232,
            0.671,
            0.25
          ],
          "content": "其中  $X_{1}, X_{2}, \\cdots, X_{n}$  是相互独立且与 X 有相同分布的随机变量序列."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.254,
            0.865,
            0.294
          ],
          "content": "为了估计 $E[h(X)]$ 的值，需要自模型产生大量的样本 $X_{i}$. 例如在 $(\\ast_{6})$ 式中取 $h(X) = X$ ，得到"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.384,
            0.297,
            0.591,
            0.334
          ],
          "content": "E (X) \\approx \\frac {1}{n} \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {n} X _ {i} = \\overline {{X}}.",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_406_equation_9.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.338,
            0.467,
            0.355
          ],
          "content": "这就是我们经常使用的数学期望的估计式."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.359,
            0.731,
            0.378
          ],
          "content": "例3 试估计数学期望 $E[\\sin (X^2)]$ ，其中 $X\\sim N(\\mu ,\\sigma^2),\\mu = 1,\\sigma^2 = 0.1^2.$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.382,
            0.868,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": "解 用分析的方法求得 $E[\\sin (X^2)]$ 的精确解是困难的，但容易用蒙特卡罗方法求得它的估计值.我们取 $n$ 充分大，例如取 $n = 1000$ ，以分布 $N(\\mu ,\\sigma^2)$ 产生样本 $X_{1},X_{2},\\dots ,X_{1000}$ ，由$(\\ast_{6})$ 式即得"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.29,
            0.45,
            0.686,
            0.489
          ],
          "content": "E [ \\sin (X ^ {2}) ] \\approx \\frac {1}{1 0 0 0} \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {1 0 0 0} \\sin (x _ {i} ^ {2}) = 0. 8 3 5 7 7 8 5.",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_406_equation_13.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.493,
            0.319,
            0.51
          ],
          "content": "R 语言的程序如下:"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.516,
            0.812,
            0.667
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```txt\n> N = 1000; k = 0.0\n> for(i in 1 : N){\n+    x < -rnorm(1,1,0.1)   % 用 rnorm() 产生 1 个服从分布 N(1,0.1²) 的随机数\n+    k < -k + sin(x^2)\n+ }\n> k/1000\n[1] 0.835 778 5\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.672,
            0.869,
            0.713
          ],
          "content": "例 4 设  $X_{1}, X_{2}$  是来自分布  $N(0,1)$  的两个相互独立的随机变量，试估计数学期望  $E(|X_{1}-X_{2}|)$ ."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.717,
            0.66,
            0.734
          ],
          "content": "解 独立地, 自分布  $N(0,1)$  抽取 n=1000 个容量为 2 的样本"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.364,
            0.739,
            0.621,
            0.757
          ],
          "content": "(x _ {1} ^ {(i)}, x _ {2} ^ {(i)}), \\quad i = 1, 2, \\dots , 1 0 0 0.",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_406_equation_18.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.762,
            0.42,
            0.78
          ],
          "content": "得到所求的 $E(|X_1 - X_2|)$ 的估计为"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.268,
            0.785,
            0.715,
            0.824
          ],
          "content": "E (\\mid X _ {1} - X _ {2} \\mid) \\approx \\frac {1}{1 0 0 0} \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {1 0 0 0} \\mid x _ {1} ^ {(i)} - x _ {2} ^ {(i)} \\mid = 1. 1 2 0 2 0 9.",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_406_equation_20.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.828,
            0.32,
            0.845
          ],
          "content": "R 语言的程序如下:"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.851,
            0.359,
            0.913
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```diff\n> N = 1000;g<-numeric(N)\n> for(i in 1:N){\n+     x<-rnorm(2)\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 407,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.393,
            0.046,
            0.623,
            0.063
          ],
          "content": "参读材料二 蒙特卡罗方法"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.8,
            0.048,
            0.866,
            0.063
          ],
          "content": "· 393 ·"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.085,
            0.399,
            0.169
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```diff\n+    g[i]< - abs(x[1] - x[2])\n+ }\n> est<- mean(g);  est\n[1]   1.120 209\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.175,
            0.447,
            0.192
          ],
          "content": "我们还能利用 $\\left(*_{6}\\right)$ 式来估计积分"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.457,
            0.197,
            0.551,
            0.228
          ],
          "content": "\\int_ {a} ^ {b} f (x) \\mathrm{d} x.",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_407_equation_4.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.234,
            0.75,
            0.25
          ],
          "content": "设随机变量  $X_{1}, X_{2}, \\cdots, X_{n}$  相互独立，且具有相同的分布，其概率密度为"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.396,
            0.257,
            0.615,
            0.31
          ],
          "content": "\\varphi (x) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} \\frac {1}{b - a}, & a <   x <   b, \\\\ 0, & \\text {其他}. \\end{array} \\right.",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_407_equation_6.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.315,
            0.256,
            0.331
          ],
          "content": "则由 $(\\ast_{6})$ 式有"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.34,
            0.799,
            0.376
          ],
          "content": "\\int_ {a} ^ {b} f (x) \\mathrm{d} x = (b - a) \\int_ {a} ^ {b} f (x) \\varphi (x) \\mathrm{d} x = (b - a) E [ f (x) ] \\approx \\frac {b - a}{n} \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {n} f (x _ {i}).",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_407_equation_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.378,
            0.31,
            0.394
          ],
          "content": "即对于充分大的 $n$ ，有"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.379,
            0.4,
            0.88,
            0.435
          ],
          "content": "\\int_ {a} ^ {b} f (x) \\mathrm{d} x \\approx \\frac {b - a}{n} \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {n} f (x _ {i}). \\tag {*7}",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_407_equation_10.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.438,
            0.413,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": "例 5 试估计积分  $\\int_{0}^{2\\pi} e^{\\cos x} dx$ ."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.475,
            0.381,
            0.491
          ],
          "content": "解 独立地自概率密度为"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.398,
            0.498,
            0.611,
            0.551
          ],
          "content": "\\varphi (x) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} \\frac {1}{2 \\pi}, & 0 <   x <   2 \\pi , \\\\ 0, & \\text {其他} \\end{array} \\right.",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_407_equation_13.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.557,
            0.564,
            0.573
          ],
          "content": "的均匀分布抽取样本  $x_{1}, x_{2}, \\cdots, x_{1000}$ ，由  $(*_{7})$  式得到"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.339,
            0.579,
            0.666,
            0.616
          ],
          "content": "\\int_ {0} ^ {2 \\pi} \\mathrm{e} ^ {\\cos x} \\mathrm{d} x \\approx \\frac {2 \\pi}{1 0 0 0} \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {1 0 0 0} \\mathrm{e} ^ {\\cos x _ {i}} = 7. 7 5 6 5 5.",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_407_equation_15.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.62,
            0.331,
            0.636
          ],
          "content": "R 语言的程序如下:"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.642,
            0.881,
            0.813
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```diff\n> N = 1000; k = 0.0\n> for(i in 1 : N){\n+    x < -runif(1,0,2 * pi)      % 用 runif( )产生 1 个服从分布 U(0,2π)的随机变量，\n                   在 R 中用 pi 表示 π\n+    k < -k + exp(cos (x))\n+ }\n> k * 2 * pi/1000\n[1]     7.75655\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        }
      ]
    }
